      "text": "ATOMIC AND MOLECULAR               ORGANIC CHEMISTRY\n(1800–1880)                        (1820–1880)\n------------------                 ------------------\nDalton (atomic theory)             Wöhler (vital force dead)\nAvogadro (molecules, mol)          Liebig (organic analysis)\nGay-Lussac (gas laws)              Kekulé (benzene ring)\nBerzelius (symbols,                Pasteur (chirality,\n  atomic weights)                    stereochemistry)"
    },
