      "text": "PERIODIC TABLE                     PHYSICAL CHEMISTRY\n(1860–1910)                        (1880–1940)\n--------------                     ------------------\nMendeleev (periodic law)           van 't Hoff (osmosis,\nMeyer (independent period.)          stereochemistry)\nMoseley (atomic number)            Arrhenius (ionization,\nSeaborg (transuranics)               activation energy)\n                                   Nernst (3rd law, Nernst eq.)\n                                   Lewis (covalent bond,\n                                     electron pairs)\n                                   Pauling (chemical bond,\n                                     resonance, Linus)"
    },
