      "text": "EVOLUTION AND NATURALISTS          20TH CENTURY CHEMISTRY\n(1800–1900)                        (1900–1970)\n-----------------------            ------------------\nLamarck (inheritance of            Haber + Bosch (ammonia,\n  acquired characteristics)          nitrogen fixation)\nDarwin (natural selection,         Marie + Irène Curie\n  evolution)                         (radioactivity — Batch 09)\nWallace (natural selection,        Hodgkin (X-ray\n  independent)                       crystallography)\nHaeckel (recapitulation,           Crick + Watson + Franklin\n  ecology coined)                    (DNA structure)\nT.H. Huxley (Darwin's\n  bulldog, popularizer)"
