        "title": "Chemists and Naturalists - Landscape and Roster",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "These are figures who:\n1. **Discovered or defined fundamental concepts** — atomic theory, organic chemistry,\n   evolution, the periodic table, the chemical bond\n2. **Changed the conceptual framework** — not just new facts but new ways of thinking\n3. **Bridged disciplines** — the chemists who influenced biology, the naturalists\n   who made geography quantitative\n4. **Leave artifacts still in daily use** — Avogadro's number, Arrhenius equation,\n   Mendeleev's table, the double helix"
    }
